Why can't I use TransformData on the header or footer?
Like this:
```js
search.addWidget(
            instantsearch.widgets.refinementList({
                container: '#container',
                attributeName: 'Attribute',
                sortBy: ['name:asc'],
                limit: 10,
                operator: 'and',
                transformData: function(data){
                    data.myValue = "some new value";
                },
                templates: {
                    header: "{{myValue}}"
                }
            })
        );
```
